      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "block_2",
          "text": "Numbers 33 gives an ordered sequence of camps and movements, including the sea crossing and the approach to Sinai. That sequence is part of the text's evidence, but assigning every ancient place-name to a modern site remains disputed. Maps of this journey should therefore distinguish the biblical itinerary from proposed reconstructions rather than treating one modern route as certain.",
